Apni Aaba Zameen Par Sarwar Bicharahe Hai<br>
Farzande Mujtaba Ke Tukdhe Utha Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
1.Guth Guth Ke Marna Jaaye Beti Hussain Ki Ab<br>
Aale Nabi Tapadhkar Har Dum Suna Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
2.Misle Janab-e-Hyder Sar Hai Shigafta Aa<br>
Kandhe Pe Daale Sarwar Maidan Se Laa Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
3.Farwa Ka Laal Dulha Phir Kar Jo Ghar Me Aaya<br>
Kubra Dulhan Ku Laakar Baazu Bitha Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
4.Binte Hussain Par Hai Sakta Sa Ek Taari<br>
Ghabra Ke Bibiyan Sab Usku Jaaga Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
5.Matam Jahan Me Karlo Dulha Ka Tum Bhi Koukab<br>
Khismat Tumhari Dekho Moula Bana Reha Hai
